  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Before the discussion hall of Dark Flow Giant City, Fang Yuan studies tall stone statues bulkier than his eight arm form. Gu Ye explains that the statues are that killer move, with immortal zombies sealed inside rather than ordinary zombies, and that this deputy can command immortal zombies to fight for him. Fang Yuan silently engraves the name.",
      "chapters": [
        739
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_gu_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a fatty over six meters tall, at least three times fatter than Fang Yuan’s eight arm immortal zombie form. His skin is like bronze. His stomach is like a wine vat, big and round, and his face, arms, and fingers are all extremely round. Fang Yuan matches him to a flesh bronze zombie body.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yin Liu Gong holds the center seat between Dragon Commander Ye Cha and Huang Quan Weng, and all three show unconcealable rank seven aura while stationed in Dark Flow Giant City.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "role-among-the-deputies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dragon_commander_ye_cha",
        "char_huang_quan_weng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He chairs the alliance meeting that follows, issuing contribution missions such as suppressing the flame furnace and dealing with a yaksha octopus in Earth Trench.",
      "chapters": [
        741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "role-among-the-deputies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later sees Earth Trench’s entrance under Dark Flow Giant City and notes that the three rank seven immortal zombies take turns watching over it.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "role-among-the-deputies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Without the leader, only Yin Liu Gong and the other two rank sevens guard the headquarters. At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction he greets Yao Huang with careful courtesy and is pulled into a single room.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "encounter-with-yao-huang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_yao_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Seated beside Yao Huang as one of the current leaders of Northern Plains Zombie Alliance, he hears the plan to refine Resurrection From The Dead and refuses to dig up the Earth Trench graveyard, saying the dead should rest in peace. He states that even the three leaders cannot decide that alone and must inform Leader Blazing Heaven, and that his own two traitor immortal zombie bodies stay sealed by stone casket as discussion hall door defenses under ordinary circumstances.",
      "chapters": [
        757
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "encounter-with-yao-huang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_zombie_alliance",
        "gu_resurrection_from_the_dead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Old Ancestor Xue Hu’s action, Yin Liu Gong, Dragon Commander Ye Cha, and Huang Quan Weng can only watch him fly away from Dark Flow Giant City.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "continuing-duties-as-deputy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Blazing Heaven Demoness returns with Eastern Sea support, the three pay respects as those currently in charge of Northern Plains Zombie Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "continuing-duties-as-deputy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later note again places at least one of the three rank seven immortal zombies on Earth Trench guard duty while Blazing Heaven Demoness is absent from Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "continuing-duties-as-deputy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
